</div>
<div class="shrink-0 text-right">
<p class="m-0 text-[12.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums">Invoice No. 010097-2026</p>
<p class="m-0 text-xs font-medium tabular-nums">Date: October 1, 2026</p>
