<span class="whitespace-pre-line">Monthly rent – 18/F, 420 sqm (October 2026)</span>
</td>
<td class="px-2.5 py-1.5 border-l border-paper-line text-right whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums">₱357,000.00</td>
<td class="px-2.5 py-1.5 border-l border-paper-line text-right whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums">₱357,000.00</td>
</tr>
<tr class="border-b border-paper-rule align-top bg-paper-tint">
<td class="px-2.5 py-1.5  text-right whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums">1</td>
<td class="px-2.5 py-1.5 border-l border-paper-line ">
<span class="whitespace-pre-line">Association dues (October 2026)</span>
</td>
